# LFS tracking for the Space repo this build is pushed to. Nothing to do with
# this repository, which stores no build output.
#
# `*.wasm` because those are the only files a Flutter web build produces with
# any prospect of reaching Hugging Face's 10 MB LFS threshold: the engine, and
# the renderer bundled by `--no-web-resources-cdn`.
#
# Keep the `*.ext filter=lfs` shape, which deploy-web-demo.yml parses.
*.wasm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
